--- !u!114 &949067931
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 949067928}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5c4e49120649a1b4ca7c4060bed01c58, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestionGeneratorBeta
  questionPool:
  - question: ' If you have too much junk food at home, what should you do? '
    answerA: 'Give it to a friend '
    answerB: Replace it with healthier foods like fruits
    answerC: "Eat it all so it doesn\u2019t go to waste"
    answerD: 'Hide it to eat daily  '
    correctAnswer: B
    questionFilipino: Kung napakarami ninyong junk food sa bahay, ano ang dapat mong
      gawin?
    answerAFilipino: Ibigay ito sa kaibigan
    answerBFilipino: Palitan ito ng mas masustansiyang pagkain tulad ng mga prutas
    answerCFilipino: Kainin lahat para hindi masayang
    answerDFilipino: Itago para kainin araw-araw
  - question: " If you\u2019re preparing breakfast, what\u2019s a healthy choice?"
    answerA: Sugary cereal and soda
    answerB: Pork rinds and soda
    answerC: Egg, rice, and fruit
    answerD: Cake and coffee
    correctAnswer: C
    questionFilipino: Kung naghahanda ka ng almusal, alin ang masustansiyang pagpipilian?
    answerAFilipino: Matamis na cereal at soft drinks
    answerBFilipino: Chicharon at soft drinks
    answerCFilipino: Itlog, kanin, at prutas
    answerDFilipino: Keyk at kape
  - question: "If you\u2019re playing outside and feel hungry, what\u2019s the best
      snack?"
    answerA: Potato chips
    answerB: Watermelon
    answerC: Soda
    answerD: 'Candy bar '
    correctAnswer: B
    questionFilipino: Kung naglalaro ka sa labas at nagugutom, ano ang pinakamainam
      na meryenda?
    answerAFilipino: Potato chips
    answerBFilipino: Pakwan
    answerCFilipino: Soft drinks
    answerDFilipino: Tsokolateng kendi (candy bar)
  - question: 'For lunch, which is the best to choose with rice? '
    answerA: Fried hotdog only
    answerB: Chocolate and cake
    answerC: Chips and soft drinks
    answerD: Adobo with stir-fried vegetables
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: Sa tanghalian, alin ang pinakamainam na ulam na ipares sa kanin?
    answerAFilipino: Pritong hotdog lamang
    answerBFilipino: Tsokolate at keyk
    answerCFilipino: Chips at soft drinks
    answerDFilipino: Adobo at ginisang gulay
  - question: "If you\u2019re sick, what\u2019s the best food to help you recover
      quickly?"
    answerA: 'Soda '
    answerB: Sweet bread
    answerC: Pork rinds
    answerD: Chicken and vegetable soup
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: Kung ikaw ay may sakit, anong pagkain ang makatutulong upang
      mas mabilis kang gumaling?
    answerAFilipino: Soft drinks
    answerBFilipino: Matamis na tinapay
    answerCFilipino: Chicharon
    answerDFilipino: Sopas na may manok at gulay
  - question: ' Before watching TV, which snack would you choose?'
    answerA: Large bag of potato chips
    answerB: Two cans of soft drinks
    answerC: Candy bar
    answerD: Sliced mango
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: Bago manood ng telebisyon, anong meryenda ang pipiliin mo?
    answerAFilipino: Malaking pakete ng potato chips
    answerBFilipino: Dalawang lata ng soft drinks
    answerCFilipino: Tsokolateng kendi (candy bar)
    answerDFilipino: Hiniwang mangga
  - question: 'At a party, which plate is healthier? '
    answerA: Only pansit and soft drinks
    answerB: Only fried chicken with no vegetables
    answerC: 'A little rice, grilled fish, and vegetable salad '
    answerD: 'Only cake and ice cream '
    correctAnswer: C
    questionFilipino: Sa isang handaan, alin ang mas masustansiyang plato?
    answerAFilipino: Pancit at soft drinks lamang
    answerBFilipino: Pritong manok lamang, walang gulay
    answerCFilipino: Kaunting kanin, inihaw na isda, at ensaladang gulay
    answerDFilipino: Keyk at sorbetes lamang
  - question: "If you\u2019re buying a snack, what should you choose? "
    answerA: Soda
    answerB: Ice cream
    answerC: Sticky rice and mango
    answerD: Pork rinds
    correctAnswer: C
    questionFilipino: Kung bibili ka ng meryenda, ano ang dapat mong piliin?
    answerAFilipino: Soft drinks
    answerBFilipino: Sorbetes
    answerCFilipino: Suman at mangga
    answerDFilipino: Chicharon
  - question: "If you\u2019re an athlete, what should you eat before a game?"
    answerA: Fatty foods like fries
    answerB: Candy for energy
    answerC: Nothing, just play
    answerD: Rice, egg, and water for balance
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: Kung ikaw ay isang atleta, ano ang dapat mong kainin bago ang
      laro?
    answerAFilipino: Mamantikang pagkain tulad ng french fries
    answerBFilipino: Kendi para magkaroon ng enerhiya
    answerCFilipino: Huwag nang kumain, maglaro na lang
    answerDFilipino: Kanin, itlog, at tubig para sa balanseng pagkain
  - question: If you bring adobo and vegetables to school, how should you eat them?
    answerA: Eat only the adobo
    answerB: Eat both vegetables and adobo in balance
    answerC: Skip eating to lose weight
    answerD: Throw away the vegetables and buy chips
    correctAnswer: B
    questionFilipino: Kung may baon kang adobo at gulay sa paaralan, paano mo ito
      kakainin?
    answerAFilipino: Adobo lamang ang kainin
    answerBFilipino: Kainin ang gulay at adobo sa tamang balanse
    answerCFilipino: Huwag nang kumain para pumayat
    answerDFilipino: Itapon ang gulay at bumili ng chips
  - question: If buying at the store near school, which is better?
    answerA: Soft drinks and chicharon
    answerB: Three candies
    answerC: Bottled water and banana
    answerD: Large ice cream
    correctAnswer: C
    questionFilipino: Kung bibili ka sa tindahan malapit sa paaralan, alin ang mas
      mabuting piliin?
    answerAFilipino: Soft drinks at chicharon
    answerBFilipino: Tatlong pirasong kendi
    answerCFilipino: De-boteng tubig at saging
    answerDFilipino: Malaking sorbetes
  - question: 'After playing basketball, what is the best drink? '
    answerA: Very sweet energy drink
    answerB: Soft drinks
    answerC: 'Sweet juice '
    answerD: Water
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: Kung pupunta ka sa field trip, ano ang dapat mong ibaon para
      sa tanghalian?
    answerAFilipino: Chips at soft drinks
    answerBFilipino: Matamis na tinapay at energy drink
    answerCFilipino: Sandwich na may gulay at tubig
    answerDFilipino: Kendi at sorbetes
  - question: "If you\u2019re going on a field trip, what should you pack for lunch?"
    answerA: Chips and soda
    answerB: Sweet bread and energy drink
    answerC: Sandwich with vegetables and water
    answerD: Candy and ice cream
    correctAnswer: C
    questionFilipino: Kung naghahanda ka ng plato para sa hapunan, paano mo susundin
      ang Pinggang Pinoy?
    answerAFilipino: Punuin ito ng karne lamang
    answerBFilipino: Punuin ito ng kanin lamang
    answerCFilipino: Punuin ito ng matatamis
    answerDFilipino: Kendi at sorbetes
  - question: "If you\u2019re preparing your dinner plate, how should you follow
      Pinggang Pinoy? "
    answerA: Fill it with meat only
    answerB: Fill it with rice only
    answerC: Fill it with sweets
    answerD: Half vegetables, one-third rice, one-third fish
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: Kung naghahanda ka ng plato para sa hapunan, paano mo susundin
      ang Pinggang Pinoy?
    answerAFilipino: Punuin ito ng karne lamang
    answerBFilipino: Punuin ito ng kanin lamang
    answerCFilipino: Punuin ito ng matatamis
    answerDFilipino: Kalahating gulay, isang-kapat na kanin, at isang-kapat na isda
  - question: 'At recess time: What is better to buy at the canteen?'
    answerA: Soft drinks and candy
    answerB: Ice cream
    answerC: Banana fruit and water
    answerD: Large pack of chicharon
    correctAnswer: C
    questionFilipino: Sa oras ng recess, ano ang mas mabuting bilhin sa kantina?
    answerAFilipino: Sa oras ng recess, ano ang mas mabuting bilhin sa kantina?
    answerBFilipino: Soft drinks at kendi
    answerCFilipino: Sorbetes
    answerDFilipino: Saging at tubig
  - question: 'When preparing packed lunch for a field trip, which is the most balanced?   '
    answerA: Cake and juice
    answerB: Rice, grilled chicken, fruit, and water
    answerC: Chips, soft drinks, and candy
    answerD: 'Donut and energy drink '
    correctAnswer: B
    questionFilipino: Kapag naghahanda ng baon para sa field trip, alin ang may pinakabalanseng
      pagkain?
    answerAFilipino: Keyk at juice
    answerBFilipino: Kanin, inihaw na manok, prutas, at tubig
    answerCFilipino: Chips, soft drinks, at kendi
    answerDFilipino: Donut at energy drink
  - question: If you notice you're always eating chips at night, what is better to
      do?
    answerA: Hide them to eat daily
    answerB: Eat more chips
    answerC: Replace with fruits or vegetable sticks sometimes
    answerD: 'Make chips your dinner '
    correctAnswer: C
    questionFilipino: Kung napapansin mong palagi kang kumakain ng chips sa gabi,
      ano ang mas mabuting gawin?
    answerAFilipino: Itago ang chips para kainin araw-araw
    answerBFilipino: Kumain pa ng mas maraming chips
    answerCFilipino: Palitan ito ng prutas o hiniwang gulay paminsan-minsan
    answerDFilipino: Gawing hapunan ang chips
  - question: If you're in a hurry in the morning, which is a healthier packed meal?
    answerA: Chocolate and chips
    answerB: Peanut butter sandwich and a fruit
    answerC: Candy and soda
    answerD: Two donuts
    correctAnswer: B
    questionFilipino: Kung nagmamadali ka sa umaga, alin ang mas masustansiyang baon?
    answerAFilipino: Tsokolate at chips
    answerBFilipino: Peanut butter sandwich at isang prutas
    answerCFilipino: Kendi at soft drinks
    answerDFilipino: Dalawang donut
  - question: "For a birthday party, what\u2019s a healthy food to serve?"
    answerA: Chocolate cake
    answerB: Spaghetti with sugary sauce
    answerC: Ice cream with syrup
    answerD: Fruit salad with yogurt
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: Para sa isang birthday party, ano ang mas masustansiyang pagkain
      na ihahain?
    answerAFilipino: Chocolate cake
    answerBFilipino: Spaghetti na may matamis na sarsa
    answerCFilipino: Sorbetes na may syrup
    answerDFilipino: Fruit salad na may yogurt
  - question: 'For lunch, which is the best to choose with rice? '
    answerA: Fried hotdog only
    answerB: Chocolate and cake
    answerC: Chips and soft drinks
    answerD: Adobo with stir-fried vegetables
    correctAnswer: D
    questionFilipino: 'Sa tanghalian, alin ang pinakamainam na ulam na ipares sa
      kanin? '
    answerAFilipino: Pritong hotdog lamang
    answerBFilipino: Tsokolate at keyk
    answerCFilipino: Chips at soft drinks
    answerDFilipino: Adobo at ginisang gulay
  questionsPerGame: 10
  delayBeforeNextQuestion: 2
