  idleLines:
  - Hmmm... What could be the correct answer??
  - Think carefully!
  - You got this!
  - Take your time!
  idleLinesFilipino:
  - Hmm.. Ano kaya ang tamang sagot
  - Pag isipan mong mabuti!
  - Kaya mo yan!
  - Huwag kang mag madali!
  correctLines:
  - Yay! That's right Nya!
  - Woohoo! Correct!
  - You're so smart! Nya!
  - Amazing! Keep it up!
  - 'Purrfeect!! '
  correctLinesFilipino:
  - Yay! Tama nyan!
  - Woohoo! Tama!
  - Ang talino mo nya!
  - Ang galing! Pag patuloy mo pa!
  - Purrfeect!
